---
if (!import.meta.env.DEV) return Astro.redirect('/404');

const metadata = {
  title: 'Root Branch Learning Studio',
  ignoreTitleTemplate: true,
};
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{metadata.title}</title>
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { font-family: 'Georgia', serif; background: #ffffff; color: #1a1a1a; }
      nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 1.5rem 3rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
      }
      nav .logo {
        font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      nav .logo span { color: #2563eb; }
      nav ul {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
      nav ul a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #444;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      }
      nav ul a:hover { color: #2563eb; }
      .hero {
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 6rem 2rem 5rem;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .eyebrow {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #2563eb;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
        font-weight: normal;
        line-height: 1.2;
        color: #111;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }
      .hero h1 em { font-style: italic; color: #2563eb; }
      .hero p {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: #555;
        max-width: 620px;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      }
      .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .btn-primary {
        background: #2563eb;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-decoration: none;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .btn-secondary {
        background: transparent;
        color: #2563eb;
        padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-decoration: none;
        border: 1px solid #2563eb;
      }
      .divider {
        border: none;
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .niches {
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 5rem 2rem;
      }
      .niches h2 {
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        color: #111;
      }
      .niches .sub {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #666;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .niche-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
      @media (max-width: 640px) { .niche-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
      .niche-card {
        border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        padding: 2rem;
      }
      .niche-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        color: #111;
      }
      .niche-card p {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #666;
        line-height: 1.65;
      }
      .why {
        background: #f8f9fc;
        padding: 5rem 2rem;
      }
      .why-inner {
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .why h2 {
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        color: #111;
      }
      .why-list {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
      @media (max-width: 768px) { .why-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
      .why-item h4 {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: #111;
      }
      .why-item p {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: #666;
        line-height: 1.65;
      }
      footer {
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        padding: 2rem 3rem;
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #999;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav>
      <a href="/agency" class="logo">Root Branch <span>Learning Studio</span></a>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/agency/services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="/agency/case-studies">Work</a></li>
        <li><a href="/agency/work-with-us">Work With Us</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Boutique L&D Agency</p>
      <h1>Technical training for teams building <em>complex things.</em></h1>
      <p>
        Root Branch Learning Studio designs and develops eLearning for FinTech, SaaS, and software engineering audiences.
        We specialize in the training that's hardest to build — branching scenarios, developer onboarding, AI adoption curriculum, and technical upskilling at scale.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/agency/work-with-us" class="btn-primary">Start a Project</a>
        <a href="/agency/case-studies" class="btn-secondary">See Our Work</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section class="niches">
      <h2>Two domains. Deep expertise.</h2>
      <p class="sub">Most agencies go wide. We go deep in the two areas where training is most technically complex and most consequential.</p>
      <div class="niche-grid">
        <div class="niche-card">
          <h3>FinTech & Financial Services</h3>
          <p>Compliance training, financial product onboarding, and regulatory curriculum for teams who can't afford to get it wrong. Our accounting and financial domain knowledge means we don't just design the training — we understand the content.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="niche-card">
          <h3>Technical & Software Engineering Training</h3>
          <p>Developer onboarding, platform adoption, and upskilling curriculum for software engineering audiences. We've taught full-stack development and built AI-assisted developer training — we speak the language of the people you're training.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="why">
      <div class="why-inner">
        <h2>Why Root Branch</h2>
        <div class="why-list">
          <div class="why-item">
            <h4>We code.</h4>
            <p>Four years of frontend development means we build custom interactions, JavaScript logic, and technical simulations that most ID agencies can't touch.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-item">
            <h4>We use AI natively.</h4>
            <p>Claude, Gemini, and NotebookLM are woven into our production workflow — not as a gimmick, but to deliver faster and iterate more efficiently than traditional agencies.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-item">
            <h4>We measure outcomes.</h4>
            <p>We design for behavior change and adoption metrics, not course completions. Our work is tied to the results that matter to your business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <span>© 2026 Root Branch Learning Studio</span>
      <span>rootbranchlearning.com</span>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
